{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ecdd0f5132fbbca622c711b8818e2f27ff0697958aa6d3955e0fe65657f172bb","ja":"みんなの映えポーズ！","zh":"大家非常上镜的姿势！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"91fee88c9fb78c1e505b9f999a1dab9a1e3465d811f807bd8c5b12c402c6b19c","ja":"「それではみなさん！　ポーズをお願いします！\n……おおっ！？　これは、いろんなハート、ですね？」","zh":"“那么各位！请摆好姿势！\n……哦哦！？这难道是，各种各样的人形爱心吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7ab1dfa8d45ff1b732afb8278babecae965fd080778ea86075e2f6582ac6735b","ja":"はい！　ありさたちを応援してくれる\nたくさんの人たちに、感謝や愛を伝えたくて！","zh":"是的！为了向支持亚利沙她们的\n许许多多的人，传达感谢与爱意！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"240877411f3722265f956c57933575b80c24dab6194674573bd28ecd9fb58561","ja":"私は、両手で大きなハートを作りました♪\nいただいた愛を、少しでもお返しできますように♪","zh":"我用双手比出了一颗大大的爱心♪\n希望多少能回馈大家给予我的爱♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5866e9420864711ab1b8129b1ca5d3e82be3e44b6a90d8951e44af383c09e2ab","ja":"私は指ハートダブルで！　ファンやお友達、家族、\n事務所の人……支えてくれるみんなに届きますように！","zh":"我要双手比心！希望能传达给粉丝、朋友们、家人、\n事务所的大家……每一个支持着我的人！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0ec5ca83913fd8367a28e55be9059cb97386c0ce7af5533e1805a6c1cf8a90ca","ja":"ワアアアアアアッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"f0a125a28c30282af7cf655eeef503d46437767c843f0a8be82d173b7518f75e","ja":"最後のポーズ、すっごく盛り上がってくれたね♪\nアドバイスありがとう、亜利沙。","zh":"最后的姿势，现场气氛超级热烈呢♪\n谢谢你的建议，亚利沙。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"57ba8eeeee021936d73852977180e32994c651451e299947af39014ba5035fe4","ja":"ファンの皆さんのおかげです～！　皆さんが声援を\n送ってくれたおかげで、思いつけました！","zh":"多亏了各位粉丝～！正是因为大家为我\n加油呐喊，我才想出来的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"125c7b343f8309ac3b304f59780637a52d83c47f6fa11f03fca9e190af5b8b7e","ja":"それでは、SNSでも皆さんの写真を堪能\n……ふぉっ！？　み、みなさん、これを見てください！","zh":"那么，在社交平台上也尽情欣赏大家拍的照片\n……呼啊！？大、大家，请看这个！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"3cbcf9c9670d2a7db06f0cc4553bf6590eb70224816b1590f33276155398248e","ja":"わあ、最後のハートの写真がバズッて……あれ！？\n他にもたくさんある！　それに、なんだか……。","zh":"哇，最后那张比心的照片引发了热议……咦！？\n还有好多别的！而且，总觉得……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"3ba586105fbdab2bf1977fed5f7f68d81bb8448be82e352309ff8d7e4c8864cb","ja":"うん。私がポーズを取った後に照れてたり、亜利沙と\n美奈子ちゃんがぶつかりそうになってたり……。","zh":"嗯。像是我摆完姿势之后觉得不好意思，还有亚利沙和\n美奈子差点撞在一起之类的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"2a820761a28b0f103fa2566622a7fd0850c23fe948fbcafa8b9c51ca185431f5","ja":"全然、『映え』じゃない写真だよね？\nでもたくさんコメントがついてる！","zh":"完全不是什么“上镜”的照片对吧？\n不过却收到了好多评论！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"2bf98683ef31841f8c7ff42985e9a7de54fe8cb521890c8d37fcfdbf78089faa","ja":"私が転びそうになったところまで……！？　これで\nごヒイキ様方は、喜んでいただけてるのでしょうか？","zh":"连我差点跌倒的地方都……！？这样一来，\n各位捧场的常客会感到开心吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"83b514f261f3691fe2f6328a5c67894463884f92aaffa2852c1f9df0db46061f","ja":"そうみたい……「これがボクの\n最高の瞬間です！」って書いてくれてるし！","zh":"好像是这样……还写着“这就是我\n最棒的瞬间！”呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"5f14b7a2e14f232ec4fab6c4d157407adecb8ef578e3f347bd390a729a143334","ja":"キメキメじゃない写真も、\n気に入ってくれてるみたいだね！","zh":"没摆架势的照片，\n看来大家也很喜欢呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"8a15b12c6a8aace17acf666243f4e6bca78c3a3cf1cb01cba8ee5ef9b0312fb9","ja":"皆さん、それぞれの『最高の瞬間』を\n見つけていただけたのですね。","zh":"看来大家，都找到了各自的\n“最精彩的瞬间”呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1734.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"bbe0d4b8b91440adba47ba148ef4c531c02f5c22192446750aaa2045c8bcb625","ja":"えへへ♪　他の投稿も、見ようよ！\nみんなの気持ち、ぜ～んぶ受け止めたいからっ！","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 也来看看其他的投稿吧！\n因为大家的心意，我全～都想要好好接下呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
